cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FIRSTLOOK-MAD in academic work, please cite it. This is a research /
  simulation prototype and NOT an operational or certified system.
title: >-
  FIRSTLOOK-MAD — Distributed UAS first-response and decision-support simulation
  prototype for wildfire in the Community of Madrid
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, auditable research and simulation prototype (digital twin) that
  evaluates whether a distributed network of potential UAS deployment points could
  reduce the Time To First Reliable Picture (TTFRP) for wildfire incidents, under
  GIS, territorial risk, flight restrictions and existing emergency resources. The
  prototype does not control drones, dispatch resources, or connect to operational
  emergency systems.
type: software
authors:
  - name: FIRSTLOOK-MAD contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-26"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - UAS
  - drones
  - decision support
  - facility location
  - GIS
  - simulation
  - reproducibility
  - Comunidad de Madrid
repository-code: "https://github.com/soroushkarahrodi79-oss/firstlook-mad"
